{"packSlug":"ca-federal","packName":"Canada (federal)","jurisdiction":"CA","ruleKey":"ca-call-ai-voice-consent","kind":"consent_required","severity":"block","appliesTo":["call"],"title":"Canada: express consent before marketing calls placed with an AI voice [COUNSEL][VERIFY]","ownerExplanation":"Calls made by an AI voice assistant may fall under the rules for automatic dialing-announcing devices. As a conservative default Vireek requires express AI-voice consent on file for Canadian marketing calls and does not accept an implied relationship window. Counsel must confirm how the rules classify AI voice calls. [COUNSEL][VERIFY]","params":{"consentType":"ai_voice","purposes":["marketing"],"requiresAiVoice":true,"evidence":"express consent"},"sourceRefs":[{"citation":"CRTC Unsolicited Telecommunications Rules (Telemarketing Rules, National DNCL Rules, ADAD Rules) under the Telecommunications Act","type":"agency_guidance","note":"Starter citation — [COUNSEL][VERIFY] confirm current text, scope and effective dates before approving."}]},
{"packSlug":"ca-federal","packName":"Canada (federal)","jurisdiction":"CA","ruleKey":"ca-call-dncl-scrub","kind":"required_notice","severity":"require","appliesTo":["call"],"title":"Canada: scrub marketing calls against the National Do Not Call List [COUNSEL][VERIFY]","ownerExplanation":"Marketing calls to Canadian numbers generally require checking the National Do Not Call List (and your own internal list) first, unless an exemption applies. Vireek reminds the team; it does not connect to the registry itself. [COUNSEL][VERIFY]","params":{"noticeId":"ca-dncl-scrub","text":"Confirm the number was checked against the National Do Not Call List and your internal do-not-call list (or that a documented exemption applies) before calling. [COUNSEL][VERIFY]"},"sourceRefs":[{"citation":"National Do Not Call List rules (CRTC) — registration, scrubbing and exemptions","type":"agency_guidance","note":"Starter citation — [COUNSEL][VERIFY] confirm current text, scope and effective dates before approving."}]},
